{
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_267_imprison_man_after_ev_talk.txt/0": "等离开\\c[52]要塞地带\\c[0]后，\r\n我会再次正式答谢你。\r\n就拜托你了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_267_imprison_man_after_ev_talk.txt/1": "哦哦，终于逃出要塞地带了……\r\n终于，终于……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_267_imprison_man_after_ev_talk.txt/2": "你是我的救命恩人。\r\n我真的非常感激。\r\n虽然微薄，请让我聊表谢意。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_267_imprison_man_after_ev_talk.txt/3": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]获得了\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_267_imprison_man_after_ev_talk.txt/4": "那么，就在这里告别吧。\r\n祝你旅途成功。\r\n真的非常感谢！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_271_stingy_map_ev_talk.txt/0": "努力吧，\r\n嘿嘿嘿……",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_271_stingy_map_ev_talk.txt/174": "我想知道[支付_$tmp1拉比斯]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_271_stingy_map_ev_talk.txt/238": "我想知道[支付_$tmp1拉比斯]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_271_stingy_map_ev_talk.txt/305": "不用了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_271_stingy_map_ev_talk.txt/1": "哦？你难道是\r\n\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]大人？\r\n嘿嘿嘿……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_271_stingy_map_ev_talk.txt/2": "怎么，看到自己不吃惊吗？\r\n别小看人，事到如今我才不会被\r\n区区僵尸吓到。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_271_stingy_map_ev_talk.txt/3": "僵尸也好，鹰也好，客人就是客人。\r\n重要的是先付钱。\r\n来吧，想不想知道前方城镇的情报？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_271_stingy_map_ev_talk.txt/4": "哦？你不就是女王陛下吗？\r\n嘿嘿嘿……\r\n想必过着非常富足的生活吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_271_stingy_map_ev_talk.txt/5": "怎么样，你的旅途不需要\r\n前方城镇的情报吗？\r\n我会给你算便宜点。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_271_stingy_map_ev_talk.txt/6": "哦？你难道是\r\n\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]大人？\r\n嘿嘿嘿……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_271_stingy_map_ev_talk.txt/7": "不想知道前方城镇的情报吗？\r\n也不是不能特别便宜地替你占卜一下。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_271_stingy_map_ev_talk.txt/8": "那就收\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]吧。\r\n一文也不能少。\r\n来吧，想知道城镇的位置吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_271_stingy_map_ev_talk.txt/9": "什么，你连这么点钱都付不起？\r\n真是穷酸啊。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_271_stingy_map_ev_talk.txt/10": "多谢……等等，你这点钱\r\n根本不够啊！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_271_stingy_map_ev_talk.txt/11": "什么，你连这么点钱都付不起？\r\n真是穷酸啊。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_271_stingy_map_ev_talk.txt/12": "确实收下了。\r\n那么，来看看附近城镇的\r\n位置吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_271_stingy_map_ev_talk.txt/13": "那么，努力吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_272_map_old_woman_ev_talk.txt/0": "请把活下去\r\n放在第一位考虑。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_272_map_old_woman_ev_talk.txt/1": "女王陛下……您果然要出发了。\r\n您是我的希望。\r\n愿您此去旅途幸运。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_272_map_old_woman_ev_talk.txt/2": "您……这就要走了吗……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_272_map_old_woman_ev_talk.txt/3": "我也要留在这座城堡里。\r\n毕竟我根本逃不过\r\n那片光……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_272_map_old_woman_ev_talk.txt/4": "至少让我告诉您\r\n前方城镇的位置吧。\r\n这是我能做的仅有之事。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_272_map_old_woman_ev_talk.txt/5": "那么，就在这里告别了……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_272_map_old_woman_ev_talk.txt/6": "我会为您讨伐堕天使而祈祷。\r\n不过……请您首先活下去。\r\n请把这件事放在第一位考虑。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_275_warp_monument_ev_find.txt/0": "被一股神秘力量拉了过去！！",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_275_warp_monument_ev_talk.txt/0": "许愿（传送）",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_275_warp_monument_ev_talk.txt/38": "不许愿",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_275_warp_monument_ev_talk.txt/0": "朝这根石柱许愿，就能移动到远处。\r\n要传送吗？\r\n[目的地可能是危险地形]",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_275_warp_monument_ev_talk.txt/1": "还是暂时算了吧……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_276_criminal_city_door_ev_talk.txt/0": "文字浮现出来。\r\n“背负恶业的勇者啊……进来吧。”\r\n门打开了……？！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_276_criminal_city_door_ev_talk.txt/1": "文字浮现出来。\r\n“罪孽深重者……进来吧。”\r\n门打开了……？！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_276_criminal_city_door_ev_talk.txt/2": "门上刻着文字……\r\n“此门不会为清白之人开启。”",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_276_criminal_city_door_ev_talk.txt/3": "看来现在的<PLAYER>\r\n无法进入其中。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_276_criminal_city_door_ev_talk.txt/4": "难道说，没有\\c[52]通缉度\\c[0]\r\n就进不去吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_276_criminal_city_door_ev_talk.txt/5": "虽然有点好奇里面是什么样子……\r\n但为了进去而犯罪，还是不太好吧……\r\n就没有其他办法了吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_277_attract_monument_ev_find.txt/0": "被一股神秘力量……\r\n吸过去了？！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_279_bone_ev_talk.txt/1": "是具尸体……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_283_black_dragon_ev_find.txt/0": "嘎嗷嗷嗷——！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_283_black_dragon_ev_talk.txt/0": "嘎嗷嗷嗷嗷——！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_283_black_dragon_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>摇晃着\r\n巨大的黑色身躯，\r\n毫不在意周围，威风凛凛地走着。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_284_trap_skeleton_ev_appear.txt/0": "\\>有人设置了陷阱！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_284_trap_skeleton_ev_talk.txt/0": "（咔嗒咔嗒咔嗒……）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_284_trap_skeleton_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>小心翼翼地\r\n抱着一只包。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_285_door_mimic_ev_find.txt/0": "识别成功！\r\n一只宝箱怪从门里出现了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_285_door_mimic_ev_talk.txt/0": "嘻嘻嘻。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_285_door_mimic_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>正一边笑着\r\n一边跳舞。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_286_melt_slime_ev_talk.txt/0": "噗叽，软弹软弹……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_286_melt_slime_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>正\r\n颤巍巍地抖动着。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_287_gelatin_slime_ev_talk.txt/0": "噗叽，软弹软弹……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_287_gelatin_slime_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>正在寻找\r\n能够与身体融合的\r\n东西……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_288_lava_slime_ev_talk.txt/0": "噗叽，软弹软弹……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_288_lava_slime_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>的身体表面\r\n像熔岩一样咕嘟冒泡。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_289_poison_slime_ev_talk.txt/0": "噗叽，软弹软弹……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_289_poison_slime_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>周围\r\n正被毒液一点点腐蚀。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_290_water_slime_ev_talk.txt/0": "噗叽，软弹软弹……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_290_water_slime_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>正在寻找阴凉处。\r\n也许是怕热。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_291_oil_slime_ev_talk.txt/0": "噗叽，软弹软弹……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_291_oil_slime_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>一会儿分成两块，\r\n一会儿又合在一起，\r\n仿佛在玩耍。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_292_gravity_slime_ev_talk.txt/0": "噗叽，软弹软弹……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_292_gravity_slime_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>经过的地方\r\n留下黏糊糊的痕迹，真恶心。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_296_dimension_lord_ev_appear.txt/0": "\\>地狱之王出现了……！\r\n敌人受到\\c[52]$tmp2层\\c[0]术式保护！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_296_dimension_lord_ev_damage.txt/0": "可恶……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_296_dimension_lord_ev_damage.txt/1": "可恶！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_296_dimension_lord_ev_damage.txt/2": "咳！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_296_dimension_lord_ev_damage.txt/3": "咕哈……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_296_dimension_lord_ev_damage.txt/4": "有点痒啊。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_296_dimension_lord_ev_damage.txt/5": "有点痒……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_296_dimension_lord_ev_darkness.txt/0": "啧！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_296_dimension_lord_ev_darkness.txt/1": "地狱之王的气息消失了……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_296_dimension_lord_ev_dead.txt/0": "咕啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_296_dimension_lord_ev_dead.txt/1": "开什么玩笑……\r\n我竟会被你这种……\r\n区区人类……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_296_dimension_lord_ev_dead.txt/2": "别以为你们打得倒我啊啊啊啊！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_296_dimension_lord_ev_dead.txt/3": "\\>\\c[51]地狱之王\\c[0]显现出真身。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_297_dimension_lord_ev_appear.txt/0": "\\>他其实就是\\c[51]Pluton\\c[0]\r\n伪装而成的！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_297_dimension_lord_ev_damage.txt/0": "可恶……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_297_dimension_lord_ev_damage.txt/1": "区区人偶！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_297_dimension_lord_ev_damage.txt/2": "区区人偶……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_297_dimension_lord_ev_damage.txt/3": "咳！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_297_dimension_lord_ev_damage.txt/4": "咕哈……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_297_dimension_lord_ev_damage.txt/5": "有点痒啊。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_297_dimension_lord_ev_damage.txt/6": "就只有这点本事吗？！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_297_dimension_lord_ev_darkness.txt/0": "啧！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_297_dimension_lord_ev_darkness.txt/1": "地狱之王的气息消失了……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_29_red_food_girl.txt/0": "！\r\n（朝这边来了！！！）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_29_red_food_girl.txt/1": "呃……你……需要药吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_29_red_food_girl.txt/2": "需要……药吗……？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_29_red_food_girl.txt/3": "啊……谢谢你……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_29_red_food_girl.txt/4": "请再来……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_29_red_food_girl_find.txt/0": "（有个变态！！！）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_29_red_food_girl_find.txt/1": "（哇！不过身材真好啊……）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_29_red_food_girl_find.txt/2": "那个……药……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_2_soul_ev_find.txt/0": "呜……呜呜……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_2_soul_ev_talk.txt/0": "请你……代替我打倒堕天使……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_300_skill_trainer_1_ev_find.txt/0": "你需要我的技艺吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_300_skill_trainer_1_ev_talk.txt/0": "嘿，你今天也很努力。\r\n那么，把我教给你的技艺\r\n用在旅途中吧！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_300_skill_trainer_1_ev_talk.txt/1": "我是技艺传道师。\r\n你嘛……哦，抱歉，\r\n看来我已经没什么能教你的了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_300_skill_trainer_1_ev_talk.txt/2": "我教的技艺有派上用场吗？\r\n只要善加运用，\r\n旅途一定会轻松不少！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_300_skill_trainer_1_ev_talk.txt/3": "我是技艺传道师。\r\n如果你愿意，我可以传授你\r\n我掌握的技艺。怎么样？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_300_skill_trainer_1_ev_talk.txt/4": "不过，要学会技艺，\r\n必须消耗你的\\c[52]能力等级\\c[0]。\r\n另外还要收一点费用。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_300_skill_trainer_1_ev_talk.txt/5": "……哦，抱歉，\r\n看来我已经没什么能教你的了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_300_skill_trainer_1_ev_talk.txt/6": "世界的某处，有一位技艺高级传道师。\r\n那个人应该能教你\r\n比我掌握的更强力技能。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_300_skill_trainer_1_ev_talk.txt/7": "从这些技艺中选择一项想学的吧。\r\n一次旅途不可能学会所有技艺。\r\n[还能向他学习\\c[52]$tmp1种\\c[0]]",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_300_skill_trainer_1_ev_talk.txt/8": "……哦，看来你现在\r\n没有能够学习的技艺。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_300_skill_trainer_1_ev_talk.txt/9": "先锻炼一番再回来吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_300_skill_trainer_1_ev_talk.txt/10": "……虽然有点难以启齿，\r\n但你的钱不够。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_300_skill_trainer_1_ev_talk.txt/11": "嗯，很遗憾，要学习那项技艺，\r\n你的能力等级还不够。\r\n只要继续锻炼，迟早就能学会。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_300_skill_trainer_1_ev_talk.txt/12": "你想学这项技艺啊，交给我吧！\r\n首先，最好亲眼看一看。\r\n听好了，来吧……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_300_skill_trainer_1_ev_talk.txt/13": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了\r\n\\c[52]冲锋\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_300_skill_trainer_1_ev_talk.txt/14": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了\r\n\\c[52]熔解武装\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_300_skill_trainer_1_ev_talk.txt/15": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了\r\n\\c[52]反重力\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_300_skill_trainer_1_ev_talk.txt/16": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了\r\n\\c[52]隐身\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_300_skill_trainer_1_ev_talk.txt/17": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了\r\n\\c[52]提取药膏\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_300_skill_trainer_1_ev_wanted.txt/0": "你这家伙，是通缉犯吧！\r\n就用我的技艺来解决你！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_301_skill_trainer_2_ev_find.txt/0": "你，需要老夫的技艺吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_301_skill_trainer_2_ev_talk.txt/0": "想必你想一次学会很多技艺，\r\n但先熟练掌握新学的技艺更重要。\r\n下次再来吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_301_skill_trainer_2_ev_talk.txt/1": "老夫是技艺高级传道师。\r\n你嘛……嗯，看来老夫已经\r\n没有能传授给你的了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_301_skill_trainer_2_ev_talk.txt/2": "好好运用你获得的力量，\r\n在战斗中闯出前路吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_301_skill_trainer_2_ev_talk.txt/3": "老夫是技艺高级传道师。\r\n看来你正在经历严酷的旅途。\r\n想知道强力的技艺吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_301_skill_trainer_2_ev_talk.txt/4": "学习技艺需要\r\n消耗你的\\c[52]能力等级\\c[0]。\r\n另外说句俗话，还需要钱。如何？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_301_skill_trainer_2_ev_talk.txt/5": "……嗯，老夫已经\r\n没有能教你的东西了。\r\n在技艺方面，你已登上高境。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_301_skill_trainer_2_ev_talk.txt/6": "但重要的是获得技艺后要做什么。\r\n拥有力量者若不自觉，\r\n便只会沉溺于力量。努力吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_301_skill_trainer_2_ev_talk.txt/7": "那就从这些中选择一项想学的技艺。\r\n一次旅途不可能学会所有技艺。\r\n[还能向他学习\\c[52]$tmp1种\\c[0]]",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_301_skill_trainer_2_ev_talk.txt/8": "……嗯，你现在\r\n没有能够学习的技艺。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_301_skill_trainer_2_ev_talk.txt/9": "你现在需要的不是技艺，\r\n而是锻炼基础。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_301_skill_trainer_2_ev_talk.txt/10": "好好看看自己的钱袋。\r\n你的钱根本不够！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_301_skill_trainer_2_ev_talk.txt/11": "你掌握自身的力量了吗？\r\n现在的你恐怕无法运用老夫的技艺。\r\n重新锻炼吧！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_301_skill_trainer_2_ev_talk.txt/12": "嗯，想学这项技艺吗。\r\n好，先看看老夫施展。\r\n牢牢烙进眼睛里吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_301_skill_trainer_2_ev_talk.txt/13": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了\r\n\\c[52]视死如归\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_301_skill_trainer_2_ev_talk.txt/14": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了\r\n\\c[52]轻盈步法\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_301_skill_trainer_2_ev_talk.txt/15": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了\r\n\\c[52]神秘油液\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_301_skill_trainer_2_ev_talk.txt/16": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了\r\n\\c[52]魔力屏障\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_301_skill_trainer_2_ev_talk.txt/17": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了\r\n\\c[52]浓缩药膏\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_301_skill_trainer_2_ev_wanted.txt/0": "嗯，是个恶徒。\r\n好久没有实际动手了……",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_302_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/233": "雇佣_\\c[52]$tmp3拉比斯\\c[0]（CHR_\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]→\\c[2]$tmp2_Insuff.\\c[0]）",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_302_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/344": "雇佣_\\c[52]$tmp3拉比斯\\c[0]（CHR_\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]→\\c[3]$tmp2\\c[0]）",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_302_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/435": "雇佣_\\c[52]$tmp3拉比斯\\c[0]（CHR_\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]→\\c[3]$tmp2\\c[0]）",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_302_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/524": "不用了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_302_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/0": "哟！我是佣兵，\r\n偶尔也当赏金猎人。\r\n怎么样，你的旅途需要护卫吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_302_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/1": "给我$tmp3拉比斯，\r\n在咱俩其中一个死掉之前，\r\n我都会和你并肩作战。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_302_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/2": "有护卫跟着会安心不少。\r\n不过似乎无法越过山地和水边。\r\n要雇佣护卫吗？\r\n\\c[52][协力NPC，需要CHR等级1]",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_302_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/3": "喂喂，你的钱不够啊！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_302_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/4": "这样啊，那也没办法。\r\n改变主意的话就叫我吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_302_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/5": "……我本来想这么说，\r\n可你身上有点臭啊。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_302_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/6": "魅力似乎不够……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_302_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/7": "好，契约成立。\r\n今后请多关照！"
}
